l=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>斜纹织物；花纹；图案</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">リン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あや</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">臭</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>臭；发臭；可疑；气味</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シュウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">くさ.い・-くさ.い・にお.う・にお.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">臭い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">くさい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">臭的；有臭味的；可疑的；蹊跷的；浮夸的；做作的；俗气的；笨拙的；不熟练的；（过于）腥膻的；味道浓烈的；带有……气味的；看起来像；显得像；有……气息的</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">面倒臭い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">めんどうくさい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">麻烦；烦人；令人厌烦</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">生臭い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">なまぐさい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">腥味的；血腥的；堕落的（指僧侣）；腐败的；败德的；世俗的；凡俗的；平凡的；可疑的；蹊跷的；靠不住的</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">悦</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>喜悦；欢喜；使喜悦</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">エツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">よろこ.ぶ・よろこ.ばす</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">刃</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>刃；刀剑；锋刃</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジン・ニン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">は・やいば・き.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">刃</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">は</span><span class=\"k-wz\">刀刃；刀锋；（电插头的）插脚；插针</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">縛</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>捆绑；束缚；逮捕；约束</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">バク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">しば.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">縛る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しばる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">捆绑；束缚；系紧；限制；约束；束缚</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">束縛</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">そくばく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">束缚；约束；桎梏；羁绊；捆绑；用绳子束缚</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">暦</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>日历；历书</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">レキ・リャク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">こよみ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">西暦</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せいれき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">公元；基督纪年；公历纪年；西历；格里历</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">暦</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こよみ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">日历；历书</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">還暦</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんれき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">还历；六十大寿（传统虚岁算法中为六十一岁，即完成一个干支纪年循环）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">宜</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>宜（适宜）；好；问候</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ギ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">よろ.しい・よろ.しく</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">適宜</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">てきぎ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">恰当的；适宜的；合适的；妥当的；适当地；相应地；酌情；酌量</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">便宜</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">べんぎ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">便利；方便；便利设施；优点；利益；权宜之计</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">盲</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>盲人；文盲；盲目</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">モウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">めくら</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">盲点</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もうてん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">视网膜盲点；盲点；弱点；漏洞</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">粋</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>精华；纯粹；时尚；精髓；精英</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">スイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">いき</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">純粋</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じゅんすい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">纯粹；真正；真实；纯正</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">粋</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">雅致；精致；时尚；品味高雅；洗练；善解人意；体贴周到；通情达理；识趣；熟悉世俗风情；谙